<address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OTA OSAMU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OUE YASUHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUGIMOTO KAZUHIDE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJIMURA, KOTA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KITAMURA, TORU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUMOTO, YUKINORI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OTA, OSAMU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OUE, YASUHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUGIMOTO, KAZUHIDE</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A device capable of providing 3-D shape data in a short time by swiping a laser beam over an object, wherein a data input unit (10) uses a camera to capture a plurality of images of the object, a modeling unit (12) provides, based on the images, 3-D shape data including color data, a forming unit (14) forms, using cutting and mold-dependent forming, a real 3-D model based on the 3-D shape data, and a coloring unit (16) colors the real 3-D model based on the color data.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif permettant de fournir des données de formes tridimensionnelles dans un court laps de temps en balayant un faisceau laser sur un objet. Selon ce dispositif, une unité d'entrée de données (10) fait appel à une caméra pour saisir plusieurs images de l'objet. Une unité de modelage (12) fournit, en fonction des images, des données de formes tridimensionnelles comprenant des données de couleur. Une unité de mise en forme (14) forme, à l'aide de systèmes de mise en forme fondé sur la coupe et l'utilisation de moules, un modèle réel tridimensionnel basé sur les données de formes tridimensionnelles. En outre, une unité de coloration (16) colorie le modèle réel tridimensionnel en fonction des données de couleurs.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>